#### Executive Summary
As software engineering transitions from syntax-level implementation to inten=
t-driven delegation, enterprise software architecture must evolve from managi=
ng manual code pipelines to building the systems that build software=E2=80=94=
the Factory Model. Modern high-reliability systems require shifting away from=
 ad-hoc vibe coding (characterized by low CapEx upfront but catastrophic OpEx=
 maintenance and token burn) toward disciplined agentic engineering. At the c=
ore of this transition is Harness Engineering: recognizing that an agent's en=
