- The Factory Model of Software Delivery: Systems architects must design auto=
mated assembly lines where human engineers author specs, constraints, and eva=
ls, while autonomous agents execute changes within sandboxed runtimes and ite=
rate against automated feedback loops.
- Context Engineering as a Financial and Latency Lever: Unstructured context =
stuffing inflates operational token expenditure and causes context rot; scala=
